---
// 睡眠数据统计报表
---
<div class="w-full min-h-[600px] flex flex-col items-center justify-start bg-base-100 pt-8 pb-24 px-4">
  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-center">Sleep Statics</h2>
  <div class="stats shadow w-full max-w-md mb-4">
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-title">本周平均睡眠时长</div>
      <div class="stat-value text-primary">7h 32m</div>
      <div class="stat-desc">比上周提升 8%</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-title">最佳单日睡眠</div>
      <div class="stat-value text-secondary">8h 15m</div>
      <div class="stat-desc">周三</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="w-full max-w-md bg-white rounded-lg shadow p-4 mb-4">
    <span class="font-semibold">睡眠趋势图</span>
    <div class="w-full h-32 bg-base-200 rounded mt-2 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-400">[趋势图占位]</div>
  </div>
  <div class="w-full max-w-md bg-white rounded-lg shadow p-4">
    <span class="font-semibold">睡眠结构分析</span>
    <div class="w-full h-32 bg-base-200 rounded mt-2 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-400">[结构分析图占位]</div>
  </div>
</div>
